(1521, 'What are the key advantages of PDO over MySQLi in modern PHP 8 development?', '### PDO vs MySQLi\n\nPDO supports 12 database engines, named placeholders (`:id`), exception-driven error handling, and direct object hydration (`PDO::FETCH_CLASS`).', 'PHP & MySQL Core to Advanced'),
(1522, 'How do you configure a production-ready PDO connection with utf8mb4, exception modes, and timeout limits?', '### Production PDO Connection\n\n```php\n$pdo = new PDO(\n    \'mysql:host=127.0.0.1;dbname=app;charset=utf8mb4\',\n    \'root\',\n    \'password\',\n    [\n        PDO::ATTR_ERRMODE => PDO::ERRMODE_EXCEPTION,\n        PDO::ATTR_DEFAULT_FETCH_MODE => PDO::FETCH_ASSOC,\n        PDO::ATTR_EMULATE_PREPARES => false,\n        PDO::ATTR_TIMEOUT => 5,\n    ]\n);\n```', 'PHP & MySQL Core to Advanced'),
