(2826, 'How to trace and profile PHP WebSocket daemon performance bottlenecks using Blackfire and OpenTelemetry?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nInstrument async event callbacks to trace function execution times, memory allocations, and I/O wait spans.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2827, 'What is the difference between Swoole Process Pools (Swoole\\Process\\Pool) and standard worker processes?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nProcess Pools manage detached long-running worker clusters with automatic health monitoring and restart on crash.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2828, 'How do you implement client heartbeat Ping/Pong monitoring in Swoole using heartbeat_check_interval?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nConfigure heartbeat_check_interval => 30 and heartbeat_idle_time => 60 so Swoole automatically closes inactive sockets at C level.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2829, 'How to protect PHP WebSocket daemons against memory fragmentation using Jemalloc (USE_ZEND_ALLOC=0)?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nDisable Zend\'s internal memory allocator to let Jemalloc manage memory pages directly with active defragmentation.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2830, 'How to design a distributed Presence Channel tracking system with Redis Sorted Sets and TTL heartbeats in PHP?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nStore connected user IDs in Redis ZSets with current timestamp scores and purge expired users with ZREMRANGEBYSCORE.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2831, 'What are the security risks of WebSocket frame fragmentation starvation and how to mitigate in PHP?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nEnforce max frame accumulation sizes and disconnect connections exceeding frame assembly deadlines.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2832, 'How does Revolt (revolt/event-loop) provide a standard async event loop interface across ReactPHP and Amp?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nDefines a unified global event loop driver supporting timers, stream IO, signals, and Fiber suspension.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2833, 'How to handle Database connection pool timeouts during high-concurrency WebSocket broadcast surges in PHP?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nUse asynchronous coroutine connection pools with acquire timeouts and minimum/maximum pool size boundaries.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2834, 'How to safely manage SSL/TLS certificate hot-reloading in persistent PHP WebSocket daemons?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nReload certificate and private key files on SIGHUP without restarting worker processes or dropping client connections.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2835, 'How do you build a real-time collaborative document synchronization server using CRDTs or OT in PHP WebSockets?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nProcess operational transformation operations or Conflict-free Replicated Data Types (CRDTs) over binary WebSocket channels.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2836, 'How do Swoole Coroutine Channels (Swoole\\Coroutine\\Channel) implement CSP concurrency in PHP?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nChannels allow coroutines to communicate and synchronize data via push() and pop() with zero locks.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2837, 'What are the performance differences between ext-uv (libuv), ext-ev, and stream_select in PHP async runtimes?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nlibuv and ext-ev use O(1) epoll/kqueue event demultiplexing, while stream_select has an O(N) array scan limit of 1024 sockets.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
(2838, 'How to configure permessage-deflate WebSocket compression in Swoole without exhausting server memory?', '### Advanced PHP WebSocket Architecture\n\nEnable websocket_compression => true in server settings and set compression_level => 3 for optimal CPU/RAM balance.\n\n#### High-Scale Architecture Rule:\nLeverage Swoole coroutines and `Swoole\\Table` shared memory, tune Linux kernel TCP buffers, and implement zero-downtime hot reloads.', 'Advanced PHP WebSocket Internals & Async Architecture'),
